<div class="draft">First draft for Dr. Simpson's review. Wording, photos and the giving link are placeholders until you approve them.</div>

<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Faith Clinic Church home">
      <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="14" fill="none" stroke="#F0C24B" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M15 6v18M9 12h12" stroke="#F0C24B" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      Faith Clinic Church
    </a>
    <nav aria-label="Main">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#watch">Watch</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#free-book">New Believers</a>
      <a href="#books">Books</a>
      <a href="#visit">Visit</a>
      <a class="give" href="#give">Give</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

<div class="hero">
  <canvas id="dawn" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow rise">Faith Clinic Christian Center · Amarillo, Texas</p>
    <h1 class="rise d1">Faith comes by <em>hearing.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede rise d2">Come hear the Word of God taught plainly, so you can believe it, live it and win in life. Under the leadership of Dr. Lee A. Simpson and Pastor Pat Simpson.</p>
    <div class="cta rise d3">
      <a class="btn gold" href="#visit">Plan your visit</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#watch">Watch live on Sunday</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="next" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="box">
      <div class="cell">
        <div class="label" id="next-label">Next service starts in</div>
        <div class="count" id="count" aria-live="off">
          <div><b id="cd-d">0</b><span>days</span></div>
          <div><b id="cd-h">00</b><span>hours</span></div>
          <div><b id="cd-m">00</b><span>min</span></div>
          <div><b id="cd-s">00</b><span>sec</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="which" id="next-which">Sunday Worship, 11:00 AM Central</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <div class="label">Sunday Worship</div>
        <div class="time">11:00 AM</div>
        <p class="small">In person and streamed live on Facebook and YouTube.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cell">
        <div class="label">Wednesday Bible Study</div>
        <div class="time">7:00 PM</div>
        <p class="small">Midweek teaching to keep your faith strong.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="portrait reveal">
      <small>Photo goes here: Dr. Lee A. Simpson and Pastor Pat Simpson</small>
    </div>
    <div class="copy reveal">
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <h2>A church where the Word is the medicine.</h2>
      <p>Faith Clinic is a place to come and get well. Well in your spirit. Well in your mind. Well in your home. We teach the Bible in a way you can understand on Sunday and use on Monday.</p>
      <p>Dr. Lee A. Simpson has been preaching and teaching for more than 40 years. He and Pastor Pat lead a church family that prays, believes God, and expects Him to keep His Word.</p>
      <blockquote>“So then faith comes by hearing, and hearing by the word of God.”<cite>Romans 10:17, NKJV</cite></blockquote>
      <div class="facts">
        <div><b>40+</b><span>years of ministry</span></div>
        <div><b>2</b><span>services every week</span></div>
        <div><b>Live</b><span>on Facebook and YouTube</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="watch" id="watch">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <h2>Can't be in the building? Be in the service.</h2>
      <p>Sunday worship streams live at 11:00 AM Central. Past messages stay online so you can hear them again.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="watch-grid">
      <div class="screen reveal">
        <div>
          <div class="play"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="#0F1D38"/></svg></div>
          <h3>The latest message plays here</h3>
          <p>On the live site, this box shows your newest YouTube sermon automatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="channels">
        <a class="chan reveal" href="https://youtube.com/faith-clinic-online-drsimpson">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="4" fill="#F0C24B"/><path d="M10 9v6l5-3z" fill="#0F1D38"/></svg>
          <div><b>YouTube</b><span>Faith Clinic Online with Dr. Simpson</span></div>
        </a>
        <a class="chan reveal" href="https://facebook.com/DrLeeSimpson">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F0C24B"/><path d="M13.2 19v-6h2l.3-2.4h-2.3V9.2c0-.7.2-1.1 1.2-1.1h1.2V6c-.2 0-1-.1-1.8-.1-1.8 0-3 1.1-3 3.1v1.6H8.9V13h1.9v6z" fill="#0F1D38"/></svg>
          <div><b>Facebook</b><span>facebook.com/DrLeeSimpson</span></div>
        </a>
        <div class="chan reveal" style="cursor:default">
          <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="none" stroke="#F0C24B" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.4" fill="#F0C24B"/><path d="M7 7a7 7 0 000 10M17 7a7 7 0 010 10" fill="none" stroke="#F0C24B" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          <div><b>Radio broadcast</b><span>Station and air times to be added</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <h2>There is a place here for your whole family.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="when">Sundays · 11:00 AM</div>
        <h3>Children's Ministry</h3>
        <p>Children learn who God is and that He loves them. They learn it in a way they enjoy, while building character and friendships.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="when">Sundays · 9:30 AM</div>
        <h3>Wise to Win</h3>
        <p>Soul winning training based on Proverbs 11:30. Learn how to share your faith and lead someone to Christ.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="when">Wednesdays · 7:00 PM</div>
        <h3>Bible Study</h3>
        <p>Verse by verse teaching in the middle of the week. Bring your Bible and your questions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gift" id="free-book">
  <div class="wrap gift-grid">
    <div class="cover reveal" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="t">I Gave My Life to Jesus. <i>Now What?</i></div>
      <div class="s">A New Believer's Guide to Knowing God, Growing in Faith, and Living the Christian Life</div>
      <div class="a">Dr. Lee A. Simpson</div>
    </div>
    <div class="copy reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Free book for new believers</p>
      <h2>You gave your life to Jesus. Here is what to do next.</h2>
      <p>Dr. Simpson wrote this guide to answer the questions every new believer has. What happened to me? How do I pray? How do I read the Bible? Tell us where to send it and it's yours, free.</p>
      <form class="signup" id="signup" novalidate>
        <label for="su-name">First name</label>
        <input id="su-name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First name" autocomplete="given-name">
        <label for="su-email">Email address</label>
        <input id="su-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email address" autocomplete="email">
        <button class="btn gold" type="submit">Send my free book</button>
      </form>
      <p class="msg" id="su-msg" role="status"></p>
      <p class="note">We will email the book to you. No cost, and you can unsubscribe any time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="books">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <h2>Books by Dr. Lee A. Simpson</h2>
      <p>A path for your growth: prayer, transformation, grace, and the marketplace.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shelf">
      <a class="book reveal" href="https://lifebookspublishing.com">
        <div class="spine b1"><b>Lord, Teach Us to Pray</b><span>Prayer</span></div>
        <p>Start here. Learn to pray and get answers.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="book reveal" href="https://lifebookspublishing.com">
        <div class="spine b2"><b>Transformation</b><span>Renewal</span></div>
        <p>Change your thinking and you change your life.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="book reveal" href="https://lifebookspublishing.com">
        <div class="spine b3"><b>Grace for Winning in Life</b><span>Grace</span></div>
        <p>What God has already given you, and how to walk in it.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="book reveal" href="https://lifebookspublishing.com">
        <div class="spine b4"><b>The Kingdom Builder</b><span>Marketplace</span></div>
        <p>Faith at work, in business and in your community.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:30px"><a class="btn line" href="https://lifebookspublishing.com">See all books at Lifebooks Publishing</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tint" id="give" style="padding-bottom:0">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="panel dark reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Give</p>
      <h2>Your giving reaches people.</h2>
      <p>Tithes, offerings and special gifts support the preaching of the Word in Amarillo, online and on the radio. Faith Clinic Crusaders Ministries is a 501(c)(3) organization.</p>
      <p><a class="btn gold" href="#give" id="give-btn">Give online</a></p>
      <p class="note" id="give-note">Your online giving link gets connected here before launch.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel reveal" id="visit">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold)">Visit</p>
      <h2>We saved you a seat.</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>Where</dt><dd>2000 N Polk St, Amarillo, Texas. Just off the Dumas Highway (US 287).</dd>
        <dt>Sunday</dt><dd>Worship at 11:00 AM</dd>
        <dt>Wednesday</dt><dd>Bible study at 7:00 PM</dd>
        <dt>Phone</dt><dd>806-381-7005</dd>
        <dt>Email</dt><dd>contact@faithclinicministries.org</dd>
      </dl>
      <p><a class="btn navy" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=2000+N+Polk+St+Amarillo+TX">Get directions</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="height:clamp(64px,9vw,112px)"></div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <strong style="color:#fff;font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.15rem">Faith Clinic Christian Center</strong><br>
      2000 N Polk St, Amarillo, Texas · 806-381-7005<br>
      Dr. Lee A. Simpson and Pastor Pat Simpson
    </div>
    <div>
      <a href="https://youtube.com/faith-clinic-online-drsimpson">YouTube</a> ·
      <a href="https://facebook.com/DrLeeSimpson">Facebook</a> ·
      <a href="https://lifebookspublishing.com">Books</a><br>
      © <span id="yr">2026</span> Faith Clinic Crusaders Ministries
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

